Maxwell (sm_50, sm_52) has no f16x2 arithmetic, and the AWQ weight dequantization kernel uses it
without the __CUDA_ARCH__ guard the other AWQ kernels carry, so ptxas refuses a CTranslate2 build
for those targets. Below sm_53 the kernel body is replaced by a trap: AWQ weights are float16,
which these cards do not offer as a compute type, and a trap fails loudly where an empty body
(assert, compiled out under NDEBUG) would leave the output uninitialized. sm_53 and above compile
exactly as upstream. Applied by the Dockerfile only when CTRANSLATE2_CUDA_ARCHES asks for one of
these architectures.

--- a/src/ops/awq/dequantize_gpu.cu
+++ b/src/ops/awq/dequantize_gpu.cu
@@ -13,6 +13,11 @@
                                                               int in_c,
                                                               int out_c)
      {
+#if defined(__CUDA_ARCH__) && __CUDA_ARCH__ < 530
+       // f16x2 arithmetic needs sm_53, and AWQ needs float16, which this GPU does not offer.
+       // Trap rather than assert: an assert is compiled out under NDEBUG.
+       __trap();
+#else
        if (blockIdx.z > 0) {
          B = B + blockIdx.z * in_c * out_c / 8;
          scaling_factors = scaling_factors + blockIdx.z * in_c * out_c / G;
@@ -60,6 +65,7 @@
        for (int i=0; i<8; ++i) {
          *(C_ptr2 + i) = B_shared[i];
        }
+#endif
      }

      template <Device D, typename InT, typename OutT>
